Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.10,报纸1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,打住 你们要是看过《终局之战》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Now, hold on. If you've seen "Endgame,"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就应该知道 面对侵略 地球人拒绝躺平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}you know invasion is not something Earth takes lying down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有侵略地球呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}This is not an invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,并且你们不是喜欢躺平吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Besides, wouldn't you like to lie down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你们难道不累吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Ugh. You must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.85,0:04:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,躺平休息下 多文几个纹身\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Put your feet up, get more tattoos,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把蚁人的角色好好塑造下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}finish rounding out this "Ant-Man" character.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.11,0:04:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们地球人不是最喜欢"休假"吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Think of it like your Earth concept of "vacation,"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就当休假到永远咯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}except permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我代表全球其他领导人表示\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I think I speak for all world leaders
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要是拒绝了你们 穷人会把我们赶尽杀绝的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}when I say that the poor people would just murder us if we made you leave, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 恐龙们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}welcome home, dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.83,0:04:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我等休假等很久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oh. I could use a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们核平它们咋样?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Should we nuke them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.73,0:04:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,柯蒂斯 我在休假呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I'm on vacation, Curtis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是翻脸比翻书还快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Well, you leaned into this fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:52.63,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,祖尼角龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Zuniceratops
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:55.93,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,冰脊龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Elvisaurus
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.01,0:04:58.47,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,斑比盗龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Bambiraptor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.55,0:05:00.85,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,挺足龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Erectopus
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:05.19,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨龙王龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Dracorex hogwartsia
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:08.69,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,哥吉拉龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Gojirasaurus
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:10.82,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,火山齿龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Vulcanodon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:12.57,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,索伦眼龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Sauroniops
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:16.61,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,布万龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Phuwiangosaurus
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:21.29,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,这些都是真的恐龙名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Those are real dinosaur names
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,老娘装不下去了 玩游戏没有一点成就感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Ugh. I can't even pretend to feel useful in a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,难道人类文明就这么终结了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}This is how humanity's story ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,摆脱一切责任 和孩子们一起干坐着?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Relieved of duty and sat at the kids' table?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我反正对这些恐龙肃然起敬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I gotta respect these dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,人类想要休闲时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}They dominated a whole species
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在给了你们又不开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}just by calling its bluff
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就这么把我们给征服了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}about wanting more free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这哪叫征服啊? 它们都不屑和我们打仗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}They didn't even dominate us because we're not worth a fight to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们简直就是行走的泰勒·派瑞电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We've become biological Tyler Perry movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,它们不过是帮我们忙而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}All they've done is help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才不需要它们帮忙啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We didn't need their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,问题又不在我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We were not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家可是会回收垃圾的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}This house recycles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,垃圾分类是垃圾厂的事啊!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}They sort it at the trash facility!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼?我跳舞的视频怎么一个赞都没有?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What the "F"? My dance videos are getting, like, zero likes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙把抖音上的恋童癖都给封了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oh, yeah. The dinos kicked pedophiles off TikTok.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那我现在怎么赚钱?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Great. So, now I'm broke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在不需要钱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You don't need money anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那手机现在还有什么用啊?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}So, what's this for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,难道用来打电话吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Phone calls? Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 你难道不讨厌这样子吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oh, c'mon, Dad. You don't hate this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.93,0:06:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么讨厌的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在做自己喜欢做的事情呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I was already doing what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还蛮好笑的 因为你们现在和杰瑞没有什么差别了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I do think it's kind of funny that you're all basically Jerry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 你怎么做到的啊?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Jerry, how do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 爸 你怎么做到的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yeah, Dad, how do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 你是怎么做到的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}How do you do it, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-哈? -你是怎么做到的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}- Huh? - How do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,终于等到了今天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's finally happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有人知道怎么把书稿寄给出版社吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Does anyone know how to mail things to publishers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,总统又呼叫我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Uhp. President only pages me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要么是有急事 要么是他想嗑摇头丸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}if it's an emergency or he needs Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,布尔 还好你还营业\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I'm sure glad you stayed open, Beau.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想付钱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Wish we could pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.17,0:06:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是资本主义已经被消灭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}but no more capitalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.30,0:06:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,总统先生 我做肋排可不是为了钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I never make ribs for the money, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oh, um, here ya go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我呼叫你又不是想要这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}That's not why I called.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.89,0:07:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,毒品怎么可能解决问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Drugs can't solve this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的生活我一天都过不下去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I can't live like this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开始几天还挺舒服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}At first it was fun spending all day
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.81,0:07:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看油管视频一天看到晚不停歇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}watching whatever YouTube autoplays after the last one autoplayed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是Grammarly的广告看多了真的会反胃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}but a man can only watch so many ads for Grammarly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.23,0:07:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克 求你帮帮我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Rick. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你不被道德伦理所束缚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You're not bound by morality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭它们 割它们的喉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Get rid of them. Slit their necks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,学《猎杀本·拉登》里把它们全干掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Zero Dark Thirty these fuckers for the good of the species.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证不说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我们过上以前的生活吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Help us go back to the old days,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们继续创造问题然后装模作样解决问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}where we pretend to fix the problems we caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一边是你 一边是拥有神力的超智慧生物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You think I'm gonna side with you over hyper-intelligent creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.49,0:07:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我凭什么帮你啊?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}operating way beyond your comprehension?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我明明更像它们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I have more in common with them than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你个目中无人的自闭傻逼!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You pompous autistic cadaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是以为你能独善其身?我-\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You think you're above this? I ought to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.29,0:07:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,总统先生 你听我一句\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Look here, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我在烹饪肋排的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}When I need my ribs to be tender and delicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,会对它们万般宠爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I pamper them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你只有愿意付出代价\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}See, if you give someone what they want,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,才能得到回报\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}they'll give you what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一点拙见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I'm jus' saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.14,0:07:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,布尔 我听懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I see your point, Beau.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那行吧 瑞克 哈哈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}All right, Rick. Ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,开个价吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Name your price.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Aw, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么这么爱用《西部世界》里那套耍我?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}How often are you "Westworld-ing" me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 肋排把他的芯片卡住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Hang on. Rib-tips jammed his folk-chip again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.57,0:07:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\fnIPix}瑞克最靠得住了\N{\fs40}Ol' reliable Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:07:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\fnIPix}{\fnIPix}总能想到办法\N{\fs40}Always k-knows what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克 你到底想要什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What do you want, Rick? .
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会放下身段回答这个问题的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I won't stoop to answering that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要什么你心知肚明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You know exactly what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那件事哪有这么容易实现啊?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I can't just snap my fingers and get you that job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那行吧 谢谢你请我吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yeah, yeah. Thanks for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Fine. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你能除掉恐龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}If you get rid of the dinosaurs...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我就让你主持奥斯卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}you can host the Oscars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\fnIPix}{\fnIPix}瑞克真是心口如一 真心实意 公正无私\N{\fs40} Righteous R-Rick. Straight shootin', t-truth-tellin',
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\fnIPix}{\fnIPix}不说谎不尿床\N{\fs40}never wets the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别了 老朋友们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Goodbye, old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,愿你们安息在地底\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}May you rest in peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,无需困在油箱里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}rather than the tank of an S.U.V.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好呀 宇宙旅行同好们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Hello, fellow cosmic voyagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有事需要我们帮忙吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Can we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我是来帮你们忙的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Actually, I can probably help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我是人类\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}See, I'm technically human,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但我和你们的水平很接近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}but I've come to be more, you know, on your level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我们不需要你帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We're fine, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我不绕弯子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Maybe I'm being too indirect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚好知道怎么穿梭于多重宇宙间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I happen to dabble in multiversal travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.11,0:08:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可以把你们送去另一个宇宙的地球上哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}and I could probably zap you guys to an alternate Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很久前就开始用传送门了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We used portal travel eons ago
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是作为最高级的生命 我们秉承"单一宇宙"政策\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}but evolved to a one-universe, one-truth policy as the highest form of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己都顾不过来 还想帮别人?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Sort of a "put your own oxygen mask on before helping others" type of a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.66,0:08:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你坐过飞机吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Have you been on a plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我坐过飞机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yes, I've been on a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是想穿梭到别的宇宙请自便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We have no problem if you jump dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们检测到你的设备不太行的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Although we sense your gateway device is suboptimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来帮你吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Let us help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不需要别人帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I don't need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来帮你们的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I-I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,传送手枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}A "Portal Pistol."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.85,0:09:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,发射的传送门是透明的 不是绿色旋涡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}The gateways are see-through, not a green swirl,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.10,0:09:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你可以提前看到传送目的地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}so now you can see where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好聪明的女孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Clever girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}台词来自《侏罗纪公园》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你想的话 我们可以把你的跨宇宙裂缝给补好哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}If you'd like, we could patch up your little interdimensional rift too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要你补 那个裂缝我知道怎么关\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}No, leave it. I know how to close that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.11,0:09:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,裂缝还没关闭是有原因的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}That's there for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了主线剧情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Very canonical.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.86,0:09:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是一直想把裂缝关上吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Don't you just want it closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,莫蒂 你站谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Morty, whose team are you on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,沮丧再正常不过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's normal to be frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天 你他娘的逗我吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oh, my God, are you fucking kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.01,0:09:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等下啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}No. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,3271)}什么鬼-\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What the fuuuuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到自己的骨头了诶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}-Ah! I saw my bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.48,0:09:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一群学曼哈顿博士的傻逼竟敢传送我?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Aah! Dr. Manhattan high-road assholes teleporting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么-一点也不疼啊?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Why -- Why wasn't that painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,都没传送对好吗!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}They didn't even do it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我-我-我裤链开了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}My -- My -- My fly is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你裤链一直都是开的啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Your fly was already down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干嘛啊?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What are you doing with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.30,0:09:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克 这把明明更高级-\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Rick, it was a better --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的东西就没有高级的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Nothing from them is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,传送手枪上全是小人得志病菌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}That thing had uptight Zen snob germs all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是准备和它们开打吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}So, what, now you're gonna fight them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然后证明我们既暴力又傻逼吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}And prove we're violent and stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不打它们 我来扒一扒它们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}No. We're gonna find out what they're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,过去越操蛋 现在就越爱装清高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Only people who have really fucked up in the past have to virtue signal this hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,比如西恩·潘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Look at Sean Penn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}麦当娜前夫 曾经家暴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:10:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是瑞克啊  它们说的就是你现在这种想法啊?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}But, Rick, aren't these feelings, like, what they're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,生命"在进化早期会互相激烈竞争"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Like, life gets, um... "programmed for competition by early stages of evolution."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,比如阿米巴原虫间会争夺能量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Like, amoebas have to fight amoebas for energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果某物种能依靠机器获取足够引发糖尿病的糖分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}but once a species can get enough sugar from a machine to give itself diabetes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.45,0:10:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那么该物种就能开始思考冲突之外的问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}it's allowed to start thinking beyond conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,册子上都写得有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I mean, it's all in their pamphlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,莫蒂 你真是个天才\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Morty, you're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,当然我夸你是阴阳怪气了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I clearly mean that in the '90s ironic sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这本自吹自捧的册子其实是藏宝图\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}but this self-fellating zine is a treasure map
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,上面标记的全是它们肮脏的过往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}to every fossilized bone in their skeleton closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,咱俩就像《侏罗纪公园》里的劳拉·邓恩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}They're gonna call us Laura Dern
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,准备双手掏恐龙粪 好好扒一扒它们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}because we're about to get elbow deep in dino doo-doo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,莫蒂你听懂了吗?手套?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Get it, Morty? The gloves?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,《侏罗纪公园》里的超长手套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You -- You remember the big gloves?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我听懂了 瑞克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yeah, no, I get it, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.89,0:10:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才说"好聪明的女孩子" 你都没听出我的梗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I said "clever girl" earlier. You didn't even react.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才在气头上呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I was angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我在找我朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Um, I'm looking for a few of my, uh, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有点像在我们之前生活在咱们星球上的骷颅头足\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Hmm. Kinda look like the Skullfeet that used to live on our planet way before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,它们灭绝很久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}They're long gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在这个星球上也灭绝了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}They're extinct here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那边的博物馆里有它们的骨头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We keep their bones in that museum over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 哇哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Um, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个星球上的人怕是帮不了我们了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}These guys aren't gonna be much help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的推断是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}The leading theory is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,骷髅头足用脚踩脑袋把自己给踩死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}the Skullfeet stepped on their own brains so much they straight-up died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜 我还想听它们唱歌呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Such a shame. Would have loved to hear them sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,唱歌?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我们推断它们以前会在扩音坑里开演唱会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yeah. We figured they used to hold huge outdoor concerts in their land amphitheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们真是大傻逼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You people are idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们手上的材料不多好吗!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Hey. We didn't have much to go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,骨头又不会说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Bones aren't big on conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不是很会说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yeah, neither are you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.89,0:11:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,雄伟的篮龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}The majestic Basketsaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很了不起?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Aren't they incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还拍了好几部系列烂片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We're even making a series of increasingly terrible movies
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说的是在主题公园里克隆它们的故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}about cloning them in a theme park.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,它们怎么了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}So what happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只知道它们喜欢在大泥碗里一起喝汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}But we do know they all loved eating communal soup out of the Great Dirt Bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.78,0:11:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像看出端倪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Starting to see a pattern here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.41,0:11:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是特别雄伟?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Breathtaking, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人错以为它们灭绝前在地球上漫步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's a common misconception that they roamed our planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,其实它们是用滑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}The truth is, they rolled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分是街头滑板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Street-style mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有的玩垂直滑板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Some vert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我来猜猜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Lemme guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有个又大又深的圆坑供"滑龙"玩滑板?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}There's a very large, deep circular indentation in which these "Grindasaurs" used to shred.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们推断他们屁股另有个脑袋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We think they had a second brain in their butt
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,能连滑三圈不带摔的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}dedicated to pulling 1080s.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,三个星球上的恐龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Three planets visited by dinosaurs,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都被陨石给灭绝了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}three apocalyptic meteor impacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:11:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,滑板给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Gi-- Gi-- Gimme the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我来试下悬崖陡滑收集数据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I'm dropping in for data.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克!悬崖陡滑是滑板里最难的!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Rick! That's the hardest thing in skateboarding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,《托尼霍克职业滑板3》里玩起来很简单啊!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It looked so easy on -- aah -- "Pro Skater 3."!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,小家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,中大奖了 莫蒂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Jackpot, Morty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是觉得恐龙有不可告人的秘密吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You still think the dinosaurs got something to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不可告人的不是秘密 是原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}No, Morty, they have a reason to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-快过来 小屁孩 -住手啊 瑞克!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}-Come here, ya little whippersnapper. -No, Rick, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-快过来 莫蒂 抱抱外公  -不要碰我啊 你手好油的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}-C'mere, Morty. Come on, gimme a hug. -No, don't touch me. Your hands are greasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么回事嘛?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.98,0:12:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你们物种摆脱责任之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's become clear your species is having a hard time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.07,0:12:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,明显难以适应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}adjusting to its reduced accountability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们决定定期举办这样的主题演讲来帮你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Our solution is to hold these regular keynotes, or talks,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你们以前发布新手机或者新宗教一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}which you used to launch new phones and religions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有人有话要说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Uhp, I see someone's eager to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 想自杀的话怎么办呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Hi. Um, what do you do when you want to kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不能自杀 不过感谢你提问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You don't do that. Thank you for asking, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大家记好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Ver-- Very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最近发现了一本人类写的书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We recently discovered a new piece of human literature
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都应该读一读\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}that we think everyone should read.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我操!我成名家了!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Holy shit! I'm a famous author!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 作者署名呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Wait, where's my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:13:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,明天起地球上一人发一本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We will distribute it to everyone on Earth tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.77,0:13:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你们不准备介绍下作者吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Excuse me. Aren't you gonna say who wrote it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不准备 因为这本书的作者肯定不需要署名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Nope. Whoever wrote it must be above needing credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这本书属于所有人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's all here in this book that belongs to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.11,0:13:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不收钱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}For free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.45,0:13:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些共产主义蜥蜴人渣!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You Communist lizard scumbags!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,书是我写的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I wrote that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我 杰瑞·史密斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Me, Jerry Smith!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们猜怎么着 恐龙其实并不邪恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Guess what. Dinosaurs are not secretly evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.71,0:13:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,它们也不是来给大家找麻烦的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}and they're not out to cause anybody trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是呢 麻烦喜欢找上它们的门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}but it turns out trouble has a way of following them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶 好耶 好耶 演讲时间到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oh, yes, yes, yes. It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所有被恐龙殖民过的星球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Literally every planet with dinosaurs on it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.97,0:13:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,最终都会被巨大的陨石砸中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}is eventually smashed by a huge space rock
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,导致大部分物种灭绝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}that takes out them and most existing life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What? That can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,沮丧也没关系啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's all right to be frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.73,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听我解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么致命陨石要跟着恐龙跑呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Why would planet-killing meteors follow dinosaurs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这些爬行动物进化成素食圣母婊的同时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}As these reptiles evolved to higher and higher levels of loving vegan godhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,另一种生命形式却退化为失去自我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}another life-form devolved into an equally selfless
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.14,0:14:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,充满仇恨、神魂恍惚的石头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}hate-filled species of barely sentient rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在太空里横冲直撞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}They hurtle through space and do as much damage
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只为消灭它们的敌人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}as they can to their chosen enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜它们以谁为敌?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}which is guess who.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 恐龙走到哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yup, everywhere these dinos go,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这些石头就飞到哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}these rocks, they come a-crashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而这一块石头…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}And this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,…正朝我们冲来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}...is headed directly towards us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所有努力难道都是…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}And all of our work? It was for...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,白费力气!这就是人生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Nothing!Bingo. Welcome to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,人生就是一艘全是漏洞的船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's a big boat with a lot of holes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.43,0:14:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们都在一条船上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}but we're all in it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 尸横遍野\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Mm. So much death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜各位灵长类\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Congratulations, primates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们统治下的地球也不是最烂的嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Looks like Earth could have done worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克先闪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Rick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要忘记收看今年的奥斯卡哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}And don't forget to tune in to this year's Oscars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 真的好难接受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Well, this is a -- a lot to take in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.99,0:14:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在喜欢玩火车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I like trains now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,心好痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Okay, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.73,0:14:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,火车最厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Trains rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙是公害!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Dinos drool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你们之前不知道陨石会跟着你们跑?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}And you had no idea about the disastrous meteors that followed in your wake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}安德森·库珀 CNN主持人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是刚知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We just learned about it like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是让人痛心的消息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Truly heartbreaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,陨石来到的时候 你们应该会把它给摧毁对吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}But I assume you're gonna destroy it when it arrives here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我们呢 在努力找非暴力的解决方案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Um, we're in the process of finding a solution that, um, doesn't involve violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,打住 你们在努力找?!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Hold on. You're in the process?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,大家听到了吧 \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Well, there you have it, Cooperheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一颗暴怒的陨石正向我们--抱歉 它们的星球冲来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}An angry species of rock is gonna slam into our sorry -- their planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,而地球的新主人们还在纠结到底要不要挡一挡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}and our new planet runners are weighing whether to let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,陨石物种是真是假咱们还不知道呢!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I mean, no one knows if the meteor species is even real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}乔·罗根 美国极右翼播客主持 前摔跤选手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}No. It's very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We all know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道什么是真的吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You know what's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,裸绞 我给你们演示下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}A rear naked choke hold. I'll show you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你说啥?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题 你们准备怎样?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Final question -- How we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为唯一能保全人类的办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We have come to the conclusion the only way
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我们离开这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}to ensure humanity will be safe is for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们决定永远离开地球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}We are leaving the planet for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:46.94,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,埃克森石油公司泄漏石油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Exxon spilling the oil
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:48.35,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,切尔诺贝利核电站炸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Chernobyl blowing up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:50.73,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,致癌石棉在蒙大拿州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Asbestos in Montana
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:52.27,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,亚特兰大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Atlantic City
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:54.69,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,二型糖尿病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Type 2 diabetes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:59.32,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,深水钻油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Deepwater deeply blew it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.99,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,巨型垃圾岛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Giant garbage island
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:05.41,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,蜜蜂快死完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}And all the bees are dying
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:10.46,Default - Copy (4),,0,0,0,,去死吧恐龙们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Fuck off and die-nosaurs
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是我磕了摇头丸吧 但是瑞克我太他娘的爱你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Maybe it's the Molly, but I fucking love you, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,摇头丸药效发作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's the Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这样挺好对吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Isn't this nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,咱俩摒弃前嫌 恐龙也离开了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Rivalries behind us, dinos gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你我两人享受当下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}two cool guys living in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.77,0:16:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 咳咳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}So, uh, like, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么穿吧?因为-\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}you know what you're gonna wear? Because --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,只能一个人上 不准带搭档\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I can't get another plus-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊?!操!是我把你弄上去的啊!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What?! I'm the one who got you the gig, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.15,0:16:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉这张餐巾-\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I feel this napkin --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这张餐巾-\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Feel this napkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好软\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}So soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到第95届奥斯卡颁奖典礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}This is the 95th annual Academy Awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大家鼓掌欢迎主持人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Now, please welcome your host,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一位赶走了恐龙的老科学家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}an old science guy who got rid of the dinosaurs...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克·桑切斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Rick Sanchez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.59,0:16:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好莱坞的白左门 给老子舔咪咪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Suck my gray tits Hollywood pinkos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克风呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Where's the mic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:16:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,缓缓升起的麦克风呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}The -- The -- The raising mic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快起来!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Bring it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,汤米呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆·汉克斯也来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Tom Hanks is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.43,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来嘛 表演一个嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}C'mon. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,来嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,表演一个嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Do ittttt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,行行行 下不为例哈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Okay, okay, one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"威尔逊"!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}"Wilson!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}电影《荒岛余生》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我是奥斯卡主持瑞克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I'm Oscar host Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,外公瑞克 真的太不可思议了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Grandpa Rick, this is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克风那招帅瞎眼了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}That microphone bit killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是跟你说过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Yeah, told you it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,难道都是演的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}That was all scripted?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.21,0:17:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯卡颁奖典礼全是演的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Every moment at the Oscars is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,去年那一巴掌也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Even that one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我顺手牵羊拿了个购物袋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Look who stole themselves a swag bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-操 Sprinkles蛋糕购物券 -咱俩平分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}-Ah, fucking Sprinkles coupon! -We're splitting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,悼念去世影人的环节加上恐龙会不会很有节目效果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Hey, so I was thinking it might be funny to add dinosaurs to the "In Memoriam."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 不上档次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Eh, it feels beneath us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,它们走了我们却不在乎更有节目效果点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's funnier that they left and we don't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.05,0:17:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是走了 但是一直想吸引我们的注意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oh, yeah, they left, but they keep begging for attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不知道吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}You haven't heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙现在正在火星上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}The dinos are just standing up there on Mars
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,手握自己的屌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}with their dicks in their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,戏真多惹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}So dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?它们准备让陨石把自己砸死吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}What, they're just gonna let the meteor hit them a-and die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:18:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 高高在上的人总会死掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}renGood. If being superior to everyone makes you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.65,0:18:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫因果报应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}I call that balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都写在我全球发行的书里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's all in my globally published book
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.55,0:18:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜被恐龙给剥夺了署名权!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}the dinos stripped my name from!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯卡到此为止\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Oscars are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我的车钥匙呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Where are my keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,操 我得赶快修好传送枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}God damn it, I need to fix portal travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会修的 但不是一蹴而就的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}And -- And I'm going to. I have a process.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最后的善举\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}Our final act of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很荣幸与你们一起为神圣的生命服务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs60}It's been an honor serving the sanctity of life with you all.
